<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Pfizer estimate cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Pfizer estimate cut.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Smith Barney analyst Christina Heuer lowered her Pfizer Inc 1997 earnings estimates to $1.65 from $1.70, her office said.</p>
<p>-- said was lowering 1997 estimate due to slowing sales of cardiovascular drug Norvasc and of antidepressant drug Zoloft.</p>
<p>-- said sales and marketing expenses are increasing due to promotion of new drugs that will be launched in 1998 and 1999.</p>
<p>-- maintained buy rating on the stock.</p>
<p>-- stock was off 2-7/8 to 58-7/8.</p>
</text>
